{
  "name": "Enrich Naver Map Korean business leads with OpenAI and draft outreach in Gmail, Sheets, and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Enrich Naver Map Korean business leads with OpenAI and draft outreach in Gmail, Sheets, and Slack\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs every six hours to extract fresh records through the **[naver-map-scraper](https://apify.com/unitbytes/naver-map-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** UnitBytes Apify actor ($0.0014 / item), remove previously seen items by `placeId`, and normalize and score the dataset (`placeId, name, category, phone`). It maps the cleaned fields for export, logs all rows to **Google Sheets**, creates a backup **CSV** file, and sends only high-priority records into **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)** for structured analysis and action drafting. The enriched fields are then merged and delivered to **Slack** and **Gmail**.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the schedule interval in **When Every 6 Hours** if six hours is not ideal for your cadence.\n- Add your Apify API token from [naver-map-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/naver-map-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) (`Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`) in **Post to Naver Map Scraper: Korean Leads & Menus API** and confirm `actorInput` in **Set Search Parameters**.\n- Connect **Google Sheets** credentials in **Append Data to Sheets** and select your destination spreadsheet.\n- Configure **OpenAI** credentials in **AI Lead Translator and SDR** and review the `gpt-4o-mini` system prompt.\n- Connect **Slack** and **Gmail** credentials on the final delivery nodes.\n- Review `minLeadScore` and `priorityKeyword` in **Set Search Parameters** before activating.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust `actorInput`, `minLeadScore`, `priorityKeyword`, the OpenAI prompt, Slack message formatting, and Gmail template fields to match your workflow. Full schema and input docs: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/naver-map-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/naver-map-scraper/)",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896
      },
      "id": "5bab9587-2bed-54c8-99f1-c9836bd5ae8a",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
